'''''Legend of Blue Eyes White Dragon''''' is a ''[[Yu-Gi-Oh! Official Card Game]]'' [[Booster Pack]], released only in Japanese on May 18, 2000. In other languages another [[Legend of Blue Eyes White Dragon|set of the same name]] is a combination of this set and ''[[Phantom God]]''.

== Features ==
This is the first reprint set in [[Series 2]]. It contained 61 cards chosen from the original ''[[Starter Box]]'' and ''[[Vol.1]]''. Cards in this set featured the [[Card layout#Series 2 layout|Series 2 layout]] introduced a month earlier by ''[[Magic Ruler]]'', with wider text boxes and narrower [[ATK]]/[[DEF]] area. All cards in this set have since been released in the ''[[Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game]]''.

The set is composed of [[Normal Monster|Normal]] and [[Fusion Monster]]s and basic [[Spell Card|Spell]] and [[Trap Card]]s.

A number of the cards from the [[Duelist Kingdom (manga arc)|Duelist Kingdom arc]] of the [[Yu-Gi-Oh! (manga)|''Yu-Gi-Oh!'' manga]] were printed in this set.

== Breakdown ==
Each pack contains five cards. Each box contains 30 packs.

The set contained 61 cards, including:
* 1 [[Secret Rare]]
* 4 [[Ultra Rare]]
* 5 [[Super Rare]]
* 11 [[Rare]]
* 40 [[Common]]

